== B. torque on loops (np.cross, discretised)
OK    square loop: x cross u = m_hat = (0, sin, cos)
OK    discretised m = I l^2 (0, sin, cos)
OK    net force zero in uniform B
OK    torque = m x B = I l^2 B sin(theta) x
OK    F(+x side) = -IlB y ; u x y = sin(theta) x
OK    u-sides: forces +-IlB cos(theta) x, along their own position line (no torque)
OK    rotation about +T turns m toward B
OK    circular tilted loop: T = m x B, F = 0
